{"id":"9fbea519a400","path":"/en/university/where-to-find-us","lang":"en","title":"Where we are - USI campuses","description":"USI has four campuses: West Campus Lugano – Main site – Via Buffi 13, Lugano East Campus Lugano – Via La Santa 1, Lugano Mendrisio Campus – Largo Bernasconi 2, Mendrisio Bellinzona Campus – Via Francesco Chiesa 5, Bellinzona USI is also present in Airolo, with the Casa della sost","section":"University","crumbs":["University"],"image":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/press-usi-corporate-ccrz-2016-lugano-vita-campus-47-web-tile-campus.jpg?itok=vBVRghON","words":87,"alternates":{"it":"/it/universita/dove-siamo","en":"/en/university/where-to-find-us"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"University","path":"/en/university"},{"label":"Where we are - USI campuses","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"gallery","items":[{"kind":"video","youtube":"ol9yOSgI4VY","caption":"Campus Tour"}]},{"t":"html","html":"<p>USI has four campuses:</p> <ul> <li><strong>West Campus Lugano</strong> – Main site – Via Buffi 13, Lugano</li> <li><strong>East Campus Lugano</strong> – Via La Santa 1, Lugano</li> <li><strong>Mendrisio Campus</strong> – Largo Bernasconi 2, Mendrisio</li> <li><strong>Bellinzona Campus</strong> – Via Francesco Chiesa 5, Bellinzona</li> </ul> <p>USI is also present in Airolo, with the Casa della sostenibilità; in Balerna, with the Archivio del Moderno; in Locarno, with the “Locarno Film Festival Professor for the Future of Cinema and Audiovisual Arts” Chair and IRSOL, affiliated with USI; and in Lugano-Cadro, with L’ideatorio.</p>"},{"t":"h","level":2,"text":"Discover our campuses"},{"t":"cards","items":[{"title":"West Campus Lugano","href":"/en/university/where-to-find-us/lugano-west-campus","image":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/press-usi-corporate-ccrz-2016-lugano-vita-campus-47-web-tile-campus.jpg?itok=vBVRghON"},{"title":"East Campus Lugano","href":"/en/university/where-to-find-us/lugano-east-campus","image":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/press-campus-est-dauria-2023-esterno-17-web-tile.jpg?itok=XyFTu-tI"},{"title":"Mendrisio Campus","href":"https://www.arc.usi.ch/en/academy-architecture/campus","image":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/press-usi-corporate-ccrz-2016-mendrisio-architettura-16-web-tile-campus.jpg?itok=_OFXjjqy"},{"title":"Bellinzona Campus","href":"/en/university/where-to-find-us/bellinzona-campus","image":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/press-campus-bellinzona-01-web-tile.jpg?itok=5z_OANeR"},{"title":"Congress venue","href":"/en/university/where-to-find-us/congress-venue","image":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/press-aula-magna-usi-01-web-tile.jpg?itok=sUZzj1nj"}]}],"ctas":[],"nav":[],"links":[],"source":"https://www.usi.ch/en/university/where-to-find-us","fetchedAt":"2026-10-08T14:59:01.538Z"}